{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"以賽亞書","commonName":"以賽亞書","title":"以賽亞書","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"37240f583e914ba42181e29fd451e0e08b4e7c4e2af1563522da6f6a9285f631","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1289},"chapter":{"number":35,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["聖潔之路"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["沙漠和乾旱之地必歡喜；",{"text":"曠野必快樂，開滿鮮花，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"無比繁盛，充滿歡聲笑語，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"享有黎巴嫩的榮耀、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"迦密和沙崙的榮美。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人們必看見耶和華的榮耀，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們上帝的榮美。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"text":"你們要使軟弱的人強壯，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使雙膝無力的人站穩。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要對膽怯的人說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「你們要剛強，不要害怕。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看啊，你們的上帝必來為你們復仇，施行報應，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂必來拯救你們。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"那時，瞎眼的必看見，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耳聾的必聽見，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"瘸腿的必跳躍如鹿，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"啞巴必歡呼歌唱；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"曠野有泉水湧流，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"沙漠裡河川奔騰；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"炙熱的沙漠變成池塘，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"旱地湧出甘泉；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"豺狼的巢穴長出青草、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"蘆葦和蒲草。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"那裡必有一條大路，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"被稱為「聖潔之路」，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"專供蒙救贖的人行走。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"污穢的人都不能走這條路，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"愚昧的人也不能信步其上。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那裡必沒有獅子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也沒有惡獸，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"沒有牠們的蹤影，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"只有蒙救贖的人行走。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華救贖的子民必歸回，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"歡唱著回到錫安，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"永遠的福樂必臨到他們頭上。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們必歡喜快樂，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"再沒有憂愁和歎息。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/35.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/36.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/34.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":10}